elasticsearch_block = Manifest(
    name="Elasticsearch",
    icon="🔍",
    classification=Classification.search_store,
    tags=["search", "index", "infra"],
    connections=[],
    info=Info(
        description=Markdown(
            "## Search projection\n"
            "\n"
            "Full-text search index providing fast channel, user, and post search across large Mattermost deployments. OpenSearch is supported as an alternative.\n"
            "\n"
            "> **Illustrative sample notes:** the checks below are design and runbook examples, not claims about an active deployment.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Responsibilities\n"
            "\n"
            "| Area | Review focus |\n"
            "| --- | --- |\n"
            "| Source | Persisted messages and searchable account data |\n"
            "| Projection | Search results can lag behind committed application state |\n"
            "\n"
            "### Walkthrough\n"
            "\n"
            "1. Create a uniquely named test post and wait for it to become searchable.\n"
            "2. Delete or restrict it and check the resulting search visibility.\n"
            "   - Capture the relevant request or job identifier.\n"
            "   - Compare the user-visible outcome with the persisted or provider state.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Failure handling\n"
            "\n"
            "**Watch for:** Search recovery should rebuild the projection without replacing the primary data.\n"
            "\n"
            "Suggested diagnostic signals: *indexing lag, rejected writes, and query latency*. Compare them over the same time window.\n"
            "\n"
            "```text\n"
            "observe the symptom\n"
            "  -> identify the affected dependency\n"
            "  -> reproduce with test data\n"
            "  -> verify recovery from the user perspective\n"
            "```\n"
            "\n"
            "### Readiness checklist\n"
            "\n"
            "- [ ] Exercise the happy path with test data.\n"
            "- [ ] Rehearse the failure and recovery path.\n"
            "- [ ] Record the owner, evidence, and follow-up in the deployment runbook.\n"
            "\n"
            "~~Assume a green process means the workflow works~~ — verify the end-to-end outcome as well.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Frameworks and tools\n"
            "\n"
            "- **Framework layers in this sample**\n"
            "  - No web framework is modeled for this component; inspect its service runtime and integration clients instead.\n"
            "- **Example development and investigation toolkit**\n"
            "  - Maven or Gradle for builds\n"
            "  - JUnit for focused tests\n"
            "  - Java Flight Recorder for runtime investigation\n"
            "- **Example observability tools**\n"
            "  - `prometheus`\n"
